## PGS CORE — already locked

Next.js App Router · React · TypeScript · Supabase Postgres/Auth/Storage/RLS/RPCs · Vercel · Tailwind CSS 4 (internal/ops with shadcn; do not replace student/public retained CSS)

| Concern | Locked choice |
|---|---|
| UI | shadcn/ui + Lucide |
| Large operational tables | TanStack Table |
| Kanban / sortable UI | dnd-kit |
| Real charts | shadcn Chart → Recharts |
| Forms | React Hook Form + Zod |
| Live comments / notifications | Supabase Realtime **only** when live delivery materially improves the workflow |
| CMS preview | Next.js Draft Mode |
| CMS rich text | Lexical **only** where actual PGS content requires rich text |
| Testing | Playwright + existing unit/type/lint/security suites |
| Observability | Sentry SDK; OpenTelemetry where justified |
